+|---|---|---|
+| `motores/lectura_segura_6g1.py` | `c1b73d4cb26f8ebc17aa873bbca694ca0cb169ad2e40988833185a5077c00407` | `833077a57c091f730c2e315460e9c11d768f0810e36b32f896b4ffdee85c2ff8` |
